---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Deep Momentum Network training signal (Lim, Zohren & Roberts 2019).
// Toy numbers computed in Python: 5 days, positions chosen by the model.
const days = [
  { r: '+1.0%', p: '+1.0', a: '+1.00%' },
  { r: '−0.5%', p: '+0.5', a: '−0.25%' },
  { r: '+0.8%', p: '+1.0', a: '+0.80%' },
  { r: '+0.2%', p: '+0.5', a: '+0.10%' },
  { r: '−0.1%', p: '−0.5', a: '+0.05%' },
];
---
<figure class="p15s">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Pipeline of a Deep Momentum Network. Past returns go into an LSTM, which outputs a position between minus one and plus one. The position times the next day's return gives the strategy's daily return. The mean and the standard deviation of those returns give a Sharpe ratio, and the loss is minus the Sharpe ratio, which is sent back to adjust the LSTM. A five-day toy table shows returns 1.0, minus 0.5, 0.8, 0.2, minus 0.1 percent, positions 1, 0.5, 1, 0.5, minus 0.5, and strategy returns 1.0, minus 0.25, 0.8, 0.1, 0.05 percent, giving a Sharpe ratio of 11.3.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Train the network on the thing you care about: risk-adjusted profit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Huấn luyện mạng theo đúng thứ bạn quan tâm: lợi nhuận đã điều chỉnh rủi ro</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="60" width="150" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="95" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>past returns</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất quá khứ</tspan></text>
    <text x="95" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>1d, 1m, 3m, 6m, 1y</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 ngày … 1 năm</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="172,92 190,92 190,86 202,96 190,106 190,100 172,100" class="arrow" />

    <rect x="206" y="60" width="130" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="loop" x="231" y="92" size="22" />
    <text x="291" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">LSTM</text>
    <polygon points="338,92 356,92 356,86 368,96 356,106 356,100 338,100" class="arrow" />

    <rect x="372" y="60" width="150" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="447" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>position z</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vị thế z</tspan></text>
    <text x="447" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>from −1 to +1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>từ −1 đến +1</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="524,92 542,92 542,86 554,96 542,106 542,100 524,100" class="arrow" />

    <rect x="558" y="60" width="168" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="642" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>z × next return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>z × lợi suất kế</tspan></text>
    <text x="642" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>daily strategy return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất chiến lược</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="728,92 736,92 736,86 746,96 736,106 736,100 728,100" class="arrow" />

    <rect x="750" y="60" width="130" height="64" rx="8" class="box key" />
    <text x="815" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>loss = −Sharpe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>loss = −Sharpe</tspan></text>
    <text x="815" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>mean ÷ spread</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>TB ÷ độ lệch chuẩn</tspan></text>

    <path d="M815,128 L815,150 L291,150 L291,130" class="back" />
    <polygon points="285,132 297,132 291,122" class="headb" />
    <text x="552" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="bk"><tspan data-lang-en>gradient: nudge the LSTM so the Sharpe ratio goes up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gradient: chỉnh LSTM để Sharpe tăng lên</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="214" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>A five-day toy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ví dụ năm ngày</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="238" class="bs lead"><tspan data-lang-en>market return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất thị trường</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="262" class="bs lead"><tspan data-lang-en>position z</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vị thế z</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="286" class="bs lead"><tspan data-lang-en>strategy return</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất chiến lược</tspan></text>
    {days.map((d, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x={230 + i * 80} y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="bs">{d.r}</text>
        <text x={230 + i * 80} y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="bs">{d.p}</text>
        <text x={230 + i * 80} y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">{d.a}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="650" y="216" width="230" height="84" rx="8" class="box key" />
    <text x="765" y="246" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>Sharpe (annualised)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe (quy năm)</tspan></text>
    <text x="765" y="280" text-anchor="middle" class="big">11.3</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say the model chose the positions above. Five days is far too short to trust: an 11.3 Sharpe ratio on five days says almost nothing about the next five. The loss follows the Deep Momentum Network paper: the negative annualised Sharpe ratio, mean × √252 over the standard deviation.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử mô hình chọn các vị thế như trên. Năm ngày là quá ngắn để tin: Sharpe 11,3 trên năm ngày gần như không nói gì về năm ngày sau. Hàm loss theo bài báo Deep Momentum Network: âm của Sharpe quy năm, trung bình × √252 chia độ lệch chuẩn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15s { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15s .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15s svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p15s text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15s .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15s .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p15s .box.key { stroke: var(--gold-icon); fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .p15s .bt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15s .bs { fill: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p15s .lead { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15s .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15s .back { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .p15s .headb { fill: var(--red); }
  .p15s .bk { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .p15s .big { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15s figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
